## Overview

This program sorts an array using recursive merge sort and pthreads. Cutoff levels can be specified through the command-line to control the level of child threads before switching to serial merge sort.

## Manifest

mergesort.c - Implementations of serial sorting, merging, thread allocation, and argument manangement.
mergesort.h - Supplied structure of declations and argument.
test-mergesort.c - Supplied testing program that provides random arrays.
